  "description": "Whether it's going on a diet or navigating high society, Yoonah never thought she'd have to worry about either... before waking up in the Brighton Empire as Lady Eleanor. Not only is \"Eleanor\" clueless when it comes to things like etiquette, but she also has to deal with snobby socialites who constantly ridicule her figure. Fortunately, the talented captain of the imperial knights and the most elegant lady in town agree to help her on her journey to health and grace. But is Eleanor prepared for the horror of eating salads 24/7 while minding all her table manners?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
